{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02730","headline":"谢都督挽歌 · 上官仪","name":"谢都督挽歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漠漠佳城幽，苍苍松檟暮。\n鲁幕飘欲卷，宛驷悲还顾。\n楚挽绕卢山，胡笳临武库。\n怅然郊原静，烟生归鸟度。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"上官仪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02730.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02730","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}